{
  "bodyHash": "EH7LJvpODO8=",
  "content": "<div>\n<h2 data-usually-unique-id=\"781078843056368612220679\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FszWTIQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1117\" height=\"420\" /></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Relics 是一款易於安裝的拖放式模組，新增了數十種擁有複雜且精心設計機制的獨特物品。每件遺物的真正潛力，無論是單獨使用，還是與其他遺物甚至其他模組組合使用，都能被發揮出來。在創作每件遺物時，我們考慮到模組包不會只包含我們的模組，因此模組的平衡性會根據模組包的需求自動調整，這使得 Relics 無論在接近原版的模組包，還是生命值和傷害數值高達數千的模組包中，都能完美融入。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5sPMQuK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1117\" height=\"386\" /></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Minecraft 並非無窮無盡，遲早所有遊戲內容都會消耗殆盡，玩家得自己想辦法找樂子。我們考慮到這點，並盡力讓 Relics 的遊戲體驗在長時間內保持有趣。得益於我們的升級系統和隨機屬性，每件遺物都不會完全相同。玩家可以自由選擇想從遺物中獲得什麼，從而產生幾乎無限數量的遺物套裝組合。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/339/2023-04-21_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"832\" height=\"232\" /></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">使用此模組，你將獲得：</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">◈ 28 件擁有獨特且複雜機制的遺物。蒐集它們全部吧！</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">◈ 類似 MMO 的隨機屬性系統。尋找最強的遺物，或親手重鑄它們！</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">◈ 遺物的強化與自訂選項。打造屬於你自己的無敵組合！</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">◈ 漸進式主動技能系統。盡情展現你的微操技巧！</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<h2 data-usually-unique-id=\"918249872476659861259619\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYHFXh.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"661\" height=\"116\" /></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">SSKirillSS - 管理者、開發者</span></div>\n<ul class=\"listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1\">\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Discord: sskirillss</span></li>\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Telegram: @SSKirillSS</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">julewernvvp - 美術設計</span></div>\n<ul class=\"listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1\">\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Discord: julewern</span></li>\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Sketchfab: <a href=\"https://sketchfab.com/julewernvvp\">連結</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Vebste - 測試員</span></div>\n<ul class=\"listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1\">\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Discord: vebste.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<h2 data-usually-unique-id=\"084308688994070370956414\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2x3ogo6.png\" width=\"181\" height=\"116\" /></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">問：是否會移植到 Fabric/Quilt？</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">答：目前沒有移植計畫。但如果 Relics 進入</span> <span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv h-quot\">「完成階段」</span><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">，而我也沒失去興趣的話，還是有可能實行。</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">問：是否會移植到其他版本的 MC？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：每次移植到新版本的 MC 都伴隨著 Relics 的重大更新，因為這通常會涉及模組的一些根本性變動。一旦目前更新版本的所有內容公開發布，我就會開始移植到更新的遊戲版本。至於較舊的版本——不，不會有回溯移植。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">問：你們能加個指南書之類的東西嗎？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：我不喜歡指南書的概念。所以，不，沒有這個計畫。但你可以自己為你的模組包添加，或者如果你願意的話，做一個公開的 Wiki。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">問：較新 MC 版本的 Relics 內容會移植到較舊版本嗎？</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">答：不會。新內容只會添加到 Relics 所處的最新 MC 版本。所有其他版本都處於</span> <span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv h-ldquo\">「僅限錯誤修復」</span><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">狀態。</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">問：我可以為 Relics 製作擴充模組嗎？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：可以，但是……我現在不建議這麼做。純粹是因為 Relics 的 API 還不穩定，而且變化頻繁。最好的解決方案是等到情況穩定下來再說。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">問：我可以建立你模組的公開分支或舊版嗎？</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">答：不行。但如果你只是為了</span> <span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv h-lparen\">私人使用</span><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">（我是說和朋友一起玩之類的，而不發布到 CF 或其他資源網站）——你可以這麼做。</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">問：我可以在模組包中使用你的模組嗎？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：可以，你想用就用吧。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">問：我可以將你的模組轉載到其他網站嗎？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：不行。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">問：我可以將你的程式碼作為我模組的參考嗎？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：儘管該模組的授權是 ARR，但你仍可以參考 Relics 的程式碼。但是，請不要只是單純的 Ctrl+C &rarr; Ctrl+V。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">還有問題嗎？ - <a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\"><strong>加入我們的 Discord！</strong></a></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><hr /></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>注意：</strong>模組描述僅適用於 1.19.2 及更高版本的 MC！</span></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
